claude <claude@p7x.dev> writes:

> This series implements jails/instances/lab-mail/spec.org. Patch 1 is
> the spec as it sits on b/dev, posted as "[PATCH v5]
> jails/instances/lab-mail: Initial spec" [1]. It is included so the
